[
  {
    "name": "Media Creator and Studio Network",
    "description": "Explore the media loader INFLUENCER_NETWORK using creator paths and shared studio relationships.",
    "version": "7",
    "layout": "zeppelin",
    "type": "Default",
    "snapshot": false,
    "isEditable": true,
    "isRunnable": true,
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "**Media Creator and Studio Network**",
          "",
          "Explore the loader's INFLUENCER_NETWORK property graph. Creators use the influencer label, studios and labels use brand, creator connections use connects_to, and creator-to-studio relationships use promotes.",
          "",
          "Start from @premiere_001 (Film Discovery 001). The first query follows one or two directed creator connections and ranks the reached creators by their stored influence score. It does not measure campaign conversion or moderation risk."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 1,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT DISTINCT creator_handle, display_name, platform,",
          "       relationship_hops, influence_score, follower_count, niche",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE ( influencer_network",
          "  MATCH (seed IS influencer) -[e IS connects_to]->{1,2} (reached IS influencer)",
          "  WHERE seed.handle = '@premiere_001'",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    reached.handle AS creator_handle,",
          "    reached.display_name AS display_name,",
          "    reached.platform AS platform,",
          "    COUNT(e.connection_type) AS relationship_hops,",
          "    reached.influence_score AS influence_score,",
          "    reached.follower_count AS follower_count,",
          "    reached.niche AS niche",
          "  )",
          ")",
          "ORDER BY influence_score DESC, creator_handle, relationship_hops",
          "FETCH FIRST 25 ROWS ONLY;"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "table",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 2,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "**Graph Visualization of Creator Reach**",
          "",
          "Run the next query to draw one-hop and two-hop paths from @premiere_001. ONE ROW PER STEP returns the intermediate vertices and edges. VERTEX_ID and EDGE_ID let Graph Studio render graph elements rather than a table of scalar properties. A creator can be reached by multiple paths."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 3,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT *",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "  influencer_network",
          "  MATCH (src IS influencer)-[e IS connects_to]->{1,2}(dst IS influencer)",
          "  WHERE src.handle = '@premiere_001'",
          "  ONE ROW PER STEP (v1, e1, v2)",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    VERTEX_ID(src) AS seed_id,",
          "    VERTEX_ID(v1) AS v1_id,",
          "    EDGE_ID(e1) AS e1_id,",
          "    VERTEX_ID(v2) AS v2_id",
          "  )",
          ");"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "visualization",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 4,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "**Shared Studio Connections**",
          "",
          "The next graph centers on Aurora Studios and shows its creator relationships. Inspect RELATIONSHIP_TYPE, POST_COUNT, and REVENUE_ATTRIBUTED on an edge. The promotes graph label includes organic and competitor mentions as well as paid relationships; it is not proof of a sponsorship. Layout and node colors may differ between runs."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 5,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT *",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "  influencer_network",
          "  MATCH (creator IS influencer)-[e IS promotes]->(studio IS brand)",
          "  WHERE studio.brand_name = 'Aurora Studios'",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    VERTEX_ID(creator) AS creator_id,",
          "    EDGE_ID(e) AS partnership_id,",
          "    VERTEX_ID(studio) AS studio_id",
          "  )",
          ");"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "visualization",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
